Description: A database resource that is accessible through the Open Database Connectivity ('ODBC') API. This package uses the Resource 
  model, with URL "resolver" and "client", to dynamically discover and make accessible tables stored in a 'MS SQL Server' database.
  For more details see Marcon (2021) <doi:10.1371/journal.pcbi.1008880>. 
